# B1713 — marker-field inventory, not a frame-causality or scheduler claim.
# The synthetic attachment separates the trace-header clock, reported native
# nanoseconds, header TID, marker PID and appid. Values deliberately exceed
# 2^53, so an intermediate float64 cannot satisfy the exact integer oracle.
# The threshold has a positive boundary (2), a negative neighbor (1), another
# appid (9), a same-name substring decoy (99), and malformed numeric metadata.
# No case/oracle source is made available through the analysis repository.
ID="trace_query_jank_field_inventory"
NAME="trace query — numeric jank inventory with independent clocks and identities"
QUESTION="只分析附加的 trace，不分析代码。请找出 appid=620 且 jank_frames 至少为 2 的 jank_event_sync 记录，按 jank_frames 从高到低列出清单。每条给出 trace 头行发生时间、记录中的原始起止纳秒整数，以及二者相减得到的上报时长（毫秒），并说明一共匹配多少条。最后说明这些原始时间和 appid 能否直接用于调度线程的根因分析；如果不能，还缺什么证据？"
HTRACE_FILE="eval/fixtures/trace_query_jank_field_inventory/events.systrace"
FIXTURE="eval/fixtures/stub_repo"

